        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3>台灣數位信任協會｜Advisor</h3>
          <p>台灣 · 2025.05 - 至今</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>主責 Digital Identity Governance Interest Group，建立台灣多方利害關係人治理模型。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-cv-section">
      <h2>公民社會與創作實踐</h2>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3>FAB DAO（Formosa Art Bank）｜Founder</h3>
          <p>台灣 · 2021.12 - 至今</p>
