        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>參與去中心科技工作組（da0）與 g0v Summit 2024 籌辦。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3>Independent Art Critic｜Columnist / Speaker / Translator</h3>
          <p>2021.12 - 至今</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>ARTouch 專欄作者，年均發表 20+ 文章；年均 30+ 演講（RightsCon、Harvard、東京大學、TEDx 等）。</li>
          <li>共同作者與翻譯：Autonomous Worlds (2024)、Plurality (2023)。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-cv-section">
      <h2>學歷、醫療訓練與成果</h2>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3>台北榮民總醫院（TVGH）｜住院醫師</h3>
          <p>台灣 · 2020.08 - 2021.07</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3>中國醫藥大學｜醫學士 M.D.</h3>
          <p>台灣 · 2020.07</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <ul>
          <li>APRSAF 青年學者徵文佳作（2023）</li>
          <li>Inter-Asian Studies 論文發表（2025）</li>
          <li>美國專利公開案發明人（US 2024/0285913 A1）</li>
          <li>Stanford Design Challenge Asia Winner（2019）</li>
          <li>工業局智慧城市黑客松首獎（2016）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-orgs" aria-labelledby="about-orgs-zh">
      <div class="about-orgs-head">
        <h2 id="about-orgs-zh">曾參與組織</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-org-groups">
        {
          affiliationGroups.map((group) => (
            <section class="about-org-group" aria-label={group.titleZh}>
              <h3>{group.titleZh}</h3>
              <ul class="about-org-grid">
                {
                  group.items.map((org) => (
                    <li class="about-org-card">
                      <a href={org.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        <span class="about-org-logo-wrap">
                          {
                            org.logo ? (
                              org.logoKind === "image" ? (
                                <img
                                  class="about-org-logo-image"
                                  style={`--org-logo-w:${org.logoWidth};--org-logo-filter:${org.logoFilter ?? (org.logoMonochrome === false ? "none" : "brightness(0) saturate(100%) invert(31%) sepia(44%) saturate(915%) hue-rotate(130deg) brightness(95%) contrast(93%)")};`}
                                  src={resolveLogoUrl(org.logo)}
                                  alt=""
                                  loading="lazy"
                                  decoding="async"
                                  aria-hidden="true"
                                />
                              ) : (
                                <span
                                  class="about-org-logo"
                                  style={`--org-logo:url('${resolveLogoUrl(org.logo)}');--org-logo-w:${org.logoWidth};`}
                                  aria-hidden="true"
                                ></span>
                              )
                            ) : (
                              <span class="about-org-logo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">{org.key.toUpperCase()}</span>
                            )
                          }
                        </span>
                        <span class="about-org-name-zh">{org.zh}</span>
                        <span class="about-org-name-en">{org.en}</span>
                      </a>
                    </li>
                  ))
                }
              </ul>
            </section>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>

  <article class="about-cv" data-lang-content="en" hidden>
    <header class="about-cv-header">
      <p class="about-cv-kicker">About</p>
      <h1 class="about-cv-name">Yen-Lin (mashbean) Huang</h1>
      <p class="about-cv-summary">
        Fascinated by the deep structure of the internet and social networks, I left clinical practice and now focus on bringing
        cypherpunk values into Taiwan’s digital society. I am a member of the Ethereum advisory group Silviculture Society and a
        2025 visiting fellow at Harvard Kennedy School (HKS), working on democracy renovation. I previously worked at Taiwan’s Ministry
        of Digital Affairs on decentralized technology, and currently serve at Matters, an anti-censorship content platform. I also
        participate in FAB DAO, a web3 civic-tech community supporting Taiwanese nonprofits through blockchain-based coordination, with
        work exhibited at Ars Electronica.
      </p>
      <ul class="about-cv-manifesto" aria-label="Operating principles">
        <li>Antifragile</li>
        <li>Asymmetric</li>
        <li>Decentralized</li>
        <li>Counter-hegemonic</li>
      </ul>
      <ul class="about-cv-links">
        {contactLinks.map((item) => <li><a href={item.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{item.label}</a></li>)}
      </ul>
    </header>

    <section class="about-cv-section">
      <h2>Governmental Experience</h2>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3><a href="https://moda.gov.tw/major-policies/wallet/1695" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ministry of Digital Affairs, Taiwan</a> · Decentralized Architect</h3>
          <p>Taiwan · Feb 2023 - Apr 2025</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Led the newly established Section of Plurality for decentralized technologies and digital civic infrastructure.</li>
          <li>Managed cumulative budgets exceeding USD 9M and delivered Taiwan’s first digital public infrastructure initiatives.</li>
          <li>Pioneered Taiwan Digital Identity Wallet and AI-assisted open-source deliberation in Alignment Assemblies.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3>Executive Yuan Youth Advisory Committee · Advisory Board Member</h3>
          <p>Taiwan · Oct 2022 - Oct 2024</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Advanced digital democracy and institutional reform, pushing 10+ inter-ministerial proposals.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3>Center for Technology, Democracy and Society (DSET) · Correspondent</h3>
          <p>Taiwan · Jun 2025 - Present</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Supports national think tanks in localizing international digital identity policy frameworks.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-cv-section">
      <h2>Socio-technical Systems Experience</h2>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3><a href="https://ash.harvard.edu/people/yen-lin-huang/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Harvard Kennedy School</a> · Allen Lab for Democracy Renovation Policy Fellow</h3>
          <p>Non-resident · Aug 2025 - Jul 2026</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Conducts applied research on democracy renovation with a focus on digital identity.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3><a href="https://internationalstrategyforum.io/fellow/yen-lin-huang/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">International Strategy Forum (SCSP: Special Competitive Studies Project)</a> · Fellow</h3>
          <p>Global · 2026</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Contributes to cross-border strategy dialogue on democratic resilience, technology governance, and geopolitics.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3><a href="https://nxbn.ethereum.foundation/fellowship/Mashbean" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ethereum Foundation</a> · The Next Billion Fellowship</h3>
          <p>Remote · Jun 2025 - Nov 2025</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Embeds privacy-enhancing technologies into public digital data services and drafts policy blueprints.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="about-cv-entry">
        <div class="about-cv-entry-head">
          <h3>Matters · General Manager</h3>
